                       Mobile: YES
                Obstacle Type: CRANE
                   Start Time: 2028-01-20 06:00
                     End Time: 2028-03-01 10:00 EST
                     Schedule: -
                  Description: -
             Location Remarks: -
      Obstacle Identification: OBST-EADD-TEMP-0009
                     Geometry: Circle by centerpoint with radius (35M)
        Geographical Accuracy: -
                    Elevation: 75 M
                       Height: -
                     Lighting: YES
          Marking Description: -
        Affected Aerodrome(s): -
              Affected FIR(s): EAAD
                         Note: -
      This example also contains a cacellation NOTAM. -->

